'''Chroma Raygun''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|Chroma]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 25th tier in the battle pass for 90,000 [[Candies (2025)|Candies]]{{Currency|Candies2025}} during the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]].  More specifically, the approximate chances of obtaining this weapon had been around 1 in 50. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The Chroma Raygun is the chroma variant of the [[Raygun]], The Chroma Raygun changes color when equipped or on a player's side. However, It displays a solid multicolor when using the “/chromatoggle” command.

== Trivia ==
* It is the chroma counterpart of the godly gun under the name [[Raygun]], which is obtained the same way.
* It partners with the godly knife [[Chroma Alienbeam]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Alien Set|Chroma Alien Set]].
* This, [[Harvester]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Gingerscope]], [[Raygun]], [[Snowcannon]], and [[Chroma Snowcannon]] are the only guns to have a unique trail and shooting sound effect.
** Additionally, this is the first chroma gun to have a unique trail and shooting sound effect.

